      ],
      "text": "CI:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " sensitivity to cobalt or vitamin B12. Early Leber's disease (hereditary optic nerve atrophy): severe, swift optic atrophy reported with cyanocobalamin."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Intensive treatment of severe megaloblastic anemia: hypokalemia (even sudden death) and thrombocytosis can occur as erythropoiesis normalizes, so monitor serum potassium and platelets."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Pernicious anemia:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " stopping the monthly injections brings back the anemia and causes irreversible spinal cord damage. Folic acid can't replace B12: > 0.1 mg/day may correct the blood counts while the neurologic damage progresses."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Initial:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " Nascobal nasal spray, one spray (500 mcg) in one nostril once weekly, at least one hour before or after hot foods or liquids."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
